- **calibration after 10 invoices** (163 seen + 55 unseen lines): 111/163 right with no AI (68 %), 0 wrong → 111/163 right with no AI (68 %), 0 wrong; accepted 0, rejected 25; search: BM25 (brand ×2) + 0.5·trigrams: right product in the top 8 for 98.2 % of lines (MRR 0.94) → trigrams: 99.4 % in the top 8 (MRR 0.93); engineer rules []; $0.2170. Spark: FMCG mismatches are Arabic/French synonyms and abbrevs plus dimensions block corrupting X-pack counts.
- **calibration after 20 invoices** (318 seen + 106 unseen lines): 229/318 right with no AI (72 %), 0 wrong → 232/318 right with no AI (73 %), 0 wrong; accepted 1, rejected 9; search: trigrams: right product in the top 8 for 99.7 % of lines (MRR 0.95) → trigrams: 99.7 % in the top 8 (MRR 0.95); engineer rules [R-0008]; $0.8729. Spark: unresolved are French abbreviations and Arabic equivalents of catalogue French words needing lexicon, digit words need exact glue fix for GR to G; search already 99.7% top8 so no change
- **calibration after 30 invoices** (459 seen + 153 unseen lines): 334/459 right with no AI (73 %), 0 wrong → 336/459 right with no AI (73 %), 0 wrong; accepted 1, rejected 8; search: trigrams: right product in the top 8 for 99.8 % of lines (MRR 0.94) → trigrams: 99.8 % in the top 8 (MRR 0.94); engineer rules []; $0.2229. Spark: unresolved is mostly Arabic generic words and French abbreviations frmg liq shamp confi frs gr with no product token match

